    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44420" root="&#xA;                        وأى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَأَى</span></b> 
                         as syn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَعَدَ</span>; imperative <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِه</span>. with
the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ه</span> of silence added; fem. corroborated form
of the imperative <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّ</span>; of which last, see a curious
ex. in the end of article <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرْفٌ الأَلِفِ</span>, in the
Mughnee.

